# sha256 of Nordic's nrfutil launcher, one line per target triple:
#
#     <sha256>  <triple>
#
# Nordic serves .../nrfutil/executables/<triple>/nrfutil without a version
# in the path, so what that URL returns changes with each release. A line
# here pins it: bin/flash-dongle.sh refuses a download that does not match
# and will not make it executable. A triple with no line is downloaded
# unverified, and the script prints the hash it got so it can be added.
#
# To add one, run bin/flash-dongle.sh on that host, check the release you
# meant to get at
# https://docs.nordicsemi.com/bundle/nrfutil/page/README.html, and paste
# the line the script prints. Verify on a machine you trust; a hash taken
# from a compromised download pins the compromise.
